  "provenance": "Transcribed from the six vendor references and fixed Azure CLI 2.91.0 and Google Cloud SDK 590.0.1 help. Each group is one effect with aliases separated by spaces. A trailing = denotes one required value for every spelling in that group, independent of the menu's insertion spelling.",
